  triage:title "Stale AdvisoryRuntime guidance in non-Exact-Target daemon doc" ;
  triage:description "docs/atm-daemon/observability.md:112,200,231 -- still lists AdvisoryRuntime as a 'Recommended daemon subsystem enum member' without the historical/retired qualifier given to sibling retired subsystems (NotificationRuntime/WatchRuntime/ReconcileRuntime), and still lists the now-deleted advisory_runtime.rs/tests_advisory.rs as forward V.2 migration targets. Deduplicated finding from arch-qa ARCH-001 = req-qa ATM-QA-002 on AD15-QA-1 (PR #480)." ;
